    "If “%@” does not appear: turn on AirPlay Receiver in macOS under General → AirDrop & Handoff. Keep Wi-Fi and Bluetooth on the device turned on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erscheint «%@» nicht: in macOS unter Allgemein → AirDrop & Handoff den AirPlay-Empfänger einschalten. WLAN und Bluetooth am Gerät eingeschaltet lassen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果未显示“%@”，请在 Mac 的“系统设置”→“通用”→“隔空投送与接力”（或“隔空投送与连续互通”）中打开“隔空播放接收器”。请保持设备上的 Wi-Fi 和蓝牙开启。"
